      "end": 685,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "It is prosecution case that the petitioner and others masquerading as government officials and took money from the victim/de facto complainant for getting them some license.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 686,
      "end": 860,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "A total sum of Rupees Twenty Nine Lakhs was taken.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 861,
      "end": 911,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Investigation is going on.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 912,
      "end": 938,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Considering the incriminating materials including the WhatsApp chat and other statements available in the case diary, I do not consider this to be a fit case for granting anticipatory bail to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 939,
      "end": 1147,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0932675302028656
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The application for anticipatory bail being C.R.M. (A) 2468 of 2025 is, thus, rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
